      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "登录、进入副本或团灭后，自动召唤朝日小仙女。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Button position: default (screen center).",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextDisabled",
      "Translated": "按钮位于默认位置（屏幕中央）。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Button saved at: (",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextDisabled",
      "Translated": "按钮位置已保存：（",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Chain Stratagem — Countdown",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.CollapsingHeader",
      "Translated": "连环计倒计时",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Custom Arena Centers",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.CollapsingHeader",
      "Translated": "自定义场地中心",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "DoT Alert — Biolysis",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.CollapsingHeader",
      "Translated": "持续伤害提醒：蛊毒法",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Enter an 8-player raid to configure its arena center.",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextDisabled",
      "Translated": "请先进入一个八人团本，再设置其场地中心。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Eos could not reach the default position (100, 100) — this arena has a non-standard center. Use /xivsch → Custom Arena Centers to configure the correct position.",
      "Context": "Plugin.VerifyEosCenterReached",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ IChatGui.PrintError",
      "Translated": "朝日小仙女无法抵达默认坐标（100, 100）。此场地的中心位置特殊，请在 /xivsch 的“自定义场地中心”中设置正确位置。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Fill X/Z fields with Eos's current position.",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "将朝日小仙女的当前位置填入 X/Z 坐标栏。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Fill X/Z fields with your current in-game position.",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "将角色的当前位置填入 X/Z 坐标栏。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "If you manually reposition Eos during a raid, auto-repositioning pauses. A placement target button (⊙) will appear on screen — click it to send Eos back to the arena center and resume auto-placement. Drag it to position it next to your pet action bar.",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextWrapped",
      "Translated": "在团本中手动移动朝日小仙女后，自动定位会暂停。点击屏幕上出现的归位按钮（⊙），即可让她回到场地中央并恢复自动定位。可将按钮拖到宠物指令栏旁。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Manual override",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextColored",
      "Translated": "手动接管",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Move the button back to the center of the screen.",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "将按钮移回屏幕中央。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Open XIVSchAssistant settings.",
      "Context": "Plugin..ctor",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ CommandInfo.HelpMessage",
      "Translated": "打开 XIVSchAssistant 设置。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Play alert sound when Biolysis falls off",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.Checkbox",
      "Translated": "蛊毒法效果消失时播放提示音",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Play sound each second",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.Checkbox",
      "Translated": "每秒播放一次提示音",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Remove custom center and revert to default (100, 100).",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "移除自定义中心并恢复默认坐标（100, 100）。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Repositions Eos to the arena center in 8-player raids. Triggers automatically when you target the boss.",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "在八人团本中选中首领时，自动将朝日小仙女移至场地中央。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Return Eos to arena center\nDrag to reposition",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawReturnToCenterButton",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.SetTooltip",
      "Translated": "让朝日小仙女回到场地中央\n拖动可调整按钮位置",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Saved custom centers:",
      "Context": "ConfigWindow.Draw",
