    {
      "Original": "[XIVSchAssistant] No target selected — please target the boss first, then click again to return Eos to the arena center.",
      "Context": "Plugin.DrawReturnToCenterButton",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ IChatGui.PrintError",
      "Translated": "[XIVSchAssistant] 未选择目标。请先选中首领，再点一次让朝日小仙女回到场地中央。",
      "Source": "library"
